import Polyfold
/-! Blind formalization of V5_13 (the text's §5.2, Corollary 5.8, p. 173).

Text: over a tame `X`, if `f⁻¹(0)` is compact, then `f^i` is an sc-Fredholm section of
`P^i : Y^i → X^i` with compact solution set.

Choices:
- Setting: `X Y : Type` (universe 0, as asked); `PX : MPolyfold X`, `P : Y → X` with the
  fibrewise linear structure as instances on the fibres, `Bd : StrongBundle PX P`; "over a tame
  `X`": `PX.IsTame` (Definition 2.37, an EQUIVALENT atlas of tame charts — a property of the given
  structure); `f` an sc-Fredholm section (presupposed: `f^i` is "an sc-Fredholm section" and the
  corollary follows Theorems 5.5–5.7 about sc-Fredholm sections), the project's
